# Repository-root .gitignore.
#
# This file did not exist before, which is how ~3000 files of virtualenv got
# committed: Win365Jackpot-Backend-main/ and Win365Jackpot-Frontend-main/
# each have their own .gitignore listing venv/, but nothing covered the
# repository root, and a .gitignore rule added *after* a path is already
# tracked has no effect on it.
#
# Nothing here is a deployment input. The cPanel task list copies
# Win365Jackpot-Backend-main/ and the Elastic Beanstalk bundle is scoped by
# Win365Jackpot-Backend-main/.ebignore, so neither reads anything at this
# level.

# ── Virtualenvs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Unanchored, so this applies at every depth. Win365Jackpot-Backend-main/venv
# is the only working one (Python 3.12.7, and what .claude/launch.json runs);
# it stays on disk and is simply never tracked. Each machine builds its own
# from requirements.txt — committing one bakes in absolute interpreter paths
# from whoever created it, which is why the two that were committed here are
# unusable on any other account.
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Nested clone ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Anchored to the root so it can only ever match this specific directory.
# JackpotsWorld/ is a second, stale clone of this same repository (frozen
# 2026-07-12, 68 commits behind, zero unique commits). Ignoring it keeps it
# out of `git status` without deleting anything.
/JackpotsWorld/

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/

# ── Claude Code ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal, machine-local settings only. Deliberately not committed: it holds
# the permission rule that lets `eb` run without a prompt, and auto-approving
# production deploys is a per-person decision, not something a clone of this
# repository should inherit. .claude/launch.json is shared and stays tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Editors / OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
